GoldenIsland_Text_1:
	.string "We’ve got two watchtowers on the\n"
	.string "island to look out for the ’MEOWTH\l"
	.string "of Bounty’.$"

GoldenIsland_Text_2:
	.string "We thought we found the ’MEOWTH of\n"
	.string "Bounty’ some time ago.\p"
	.string "Unfortunately it wasn’t meant to\n"
	.string "be...$"

GoldenIsland_Text_3:
	.string "This golden statue is made in\n"
	.string "honour of the ’MEOWTH of Bounty’.\p"
	.string "Legend says that when the ancient\n"
	.string "prophecy is fulfilled, a MEOWTH\l"
	.string "will use PAY DAY to bring wealth\l"
	.string "and happiness to the islanders.$"

GoldenIsland_Text_4:
	.string "On this island everything is all\n"
	.string "about the ’MEOWTH of Bounty’.\p"
	.string "Everyone wears whiskers and cat\n"
	.string "ears in honor of MEOWTH.$"

GoldenIsland_Text_5:
	.string "People sometimes think citizens\n"
	.string "from GOLDEN ISLAND are lunatics.\p"
	.string "I don’t see why...$"

GoldenIsland_Text_6:
	.string "GOLDEN ISLAND \n"
	.string "The Island of Bounty$"
